linux.do list restyle notice
============================

This directory implements formant's linux.do topic-list restyle. The list-as-
file-table approach (CSS over Discourse `.topic-list`, idempotent column
labels, MutationObserver for the Ember SPA) is derived from:

  Project: https://github.com/starwingcc/linuxdo-lark-ui
  Copyright: starwingcc (2026)
  License: MIT (full text in LICENSE)

Modified for formant on 2026-08-20:

* The original userscript is not copied wholesale. Branding as 「飞书云文档」,
  favicon replacement, Feishu blue tokens, document-file row icons, and the
  topic-page "document editor" skin are excluded.
* Colors and density follow formant's design tokens (`#1f4b99` accent, ~48px
  rows). Only the topic list, compact category tabs, and welcome-banner hide
  are in scope; sidebar structure and topic detail are unchanged.
* Chrome MV3 isolated-world content scripts: no MAIN-world `history.pushState`
  wrapping. SPA updates use MutationObserver and popstate.

formant's overall distribution remains GPLv3 because of the V2EX Plus derived
module; this directory retains its MIT attribution.
